  "version": "1.0.0-alpha.6",
  "notes": "## 1.0.0-alpha.6 - 2026-08-20\n\n### Features\n\n- Add an option to delete individual history items without a confirmation prompt (#1564)\n- Add an option on Windows and Linux to use the system title bar and window controls (#1566)\n- Allow the quick panel to be launched from desktop shortcuts on Wayland (#1568)\n- Show a waiting state with a cancel option while joining or switching spaces requires confirmation from another device (#1573)\n- Add command-line controls for pending joins, device trust changes, and per-device sync preferences (#1579)\n- Improve history search suggestions and keyboard completion, and make code previews clearer with line counts (#1580)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Hide the unnecessary scrollbar below quick panel tag filters (#1572)\n- Keep the history list at a readable width on wide screens (#1582)\n- Show a re-pairing notice after an upgrade when existing device connections can no longer sync (#1586)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 1.0.0-alpha.6 - 2026-08-20\n\n### Features\n\n- 新增关闭单条历史记录删除确认的选项 (#1564)\n- 新增在 Windows 和 Linux 上使用系统标题栏及窗口控件的选项 (#1566)\n- 支持通过 Wayland 桌面环境的快捷键启动快捷面板 (#1568)\n- 加入或切换空间需要其他设备确认时，现在会显示等待状态并提供取消选项 (#1573)\n- 新增管理待处理加入请求、设备信任变更和单台设备同步偏好的命令行操作 (#1579)\n- 改进历史记录搜索建议和键盘补全，并通过行数信息让代码预览更清晰 (#1580)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 隐藏快捷面板标签筛选栏下方多余的滚动条 (#1572)\n- 避免历史记录列表在宽屏上变得过宽 (#1582)\n- 升级后原有设备连接无法继续同步时，显示重新配对提示 (#1586)",
